---
description: "Keep combobox option loading colocated with component logic"
globs:
  - "SampleRag.Client/src/features/**/ui/**/*.{ts,tsx}"
  - "SampleRag.Client/src/pages/**/ui/**/*.{ts,tsx}"
  - "SampleRag.Client/src/widgets/**/ui/**/*.{ts,tsx}"
alwaysApply: false
---

- New combobox components MUST manage loading of option collections themselves (store/query inside the combobox or its own feature scope), not via parent-provided option arrays.
- Parent components should only control selected value and selection callbacks when needed.
- Keep combobox option loading logic colocated with the combobox component or a dedicated store/hook used only by that combobox.
